<!doctype html><html lang="en-AU"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>HobbyNest · Shop preview</title><meta name="description" content="A first look at HobbyNest: 3D-printed products and downloadable STL designs. The shop is being prepared."/></head><body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="preview-notice">Shop preview · Orders are not open yet</div><header class="shop-header"><a class="wordmark" href="/hobbynest" aria-label="HobbyNest home">Hobby<span>Nest</span><small>Ideas take shape here.</small></a><nav aria-label="HobbyNest navigation"><a href="#printed">Printed pieces</a><a href="#files">STL designs</a><a href="/contact">Get in touch</a></nav><a class="explore-link" href="/3d-printing">Part of Explore</a></header><main id="main"><section class="hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">3D printing · Digital designs</span><h1>A little space<br/>for big ideas.</h1><p>Meet HobbyNest: my home for 3D-printed products and designs you can make with your own printer.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#collections">Explore the collections ↓</a><a href="/contact">Say hello →</a></div></div><div class="nest-art" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 360 300" fill="none"><ellipse cx="180" cy="240" rx="128" ry="24" fill="#36594c" opacity=".08"/><path d="m180 48 100 58v116l-100 58-100-58V106Z" fill="#d9e4d9"/><path d="m80 106 100 58 100-58M180 164v116" stroke="#36594c" stroke-width="2"/>{[122,142,162,182,202,222].map(y=><path d={'M80 '+y+'l100 58 100-58'} stroke="#36594c" opacity=".25"/>)}<path d="m180 48 100 58-100 58-100-58Z" fill="#f5c6a9"/><path d="m130 106 50-29 50 29-50 29Z" fill="#fbf6ed"/><circle cx="286" cy="60" r="17" stroke="#a55134" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M286 49v22m-11-11h22" stroke="#a55134" stroke-width="2"/></svg><span>Designed digitally. Made tangible.</span></div></section><section id="collections" class="collections" aria-labelledby="collections-title"><div class="section-top"><h2 id="collections-title">Two ways to make it yours.</h2><span>Collections in preparation</span></div><div class="collection-grid"><article id="printed"><span class="number">01 · Made for you</span><h3>Printed pieces</h3><p>Physical 3D-printed products, with photographs, materials, dimensions and delivery details on each listing when the shop opens.</p><span class="status">Product collection coming soon</span></article><article id="files"><span class="number">02 · Make it yourself</span><h3>Downloadable STL designs</h3><p>Digital files for your own printer. Each listing will explain what’s included, printing guidance and the licence before you buy.</p><span class="status">Digital collection coming soon</span></article></div></section><section class="shop-note"><h2>A small shop, taking shape.</h2><p>I’m preparing the first collection. There are no products for sale or payments being collected here yet. For now, you can follow the making process through Explore or get in touch.</p><a href="/3d-printing">Projects & process →</a></section></main><footer><a class="wordmark" href="/hobbynest">Hobby<span>Nest</span></a><p>A business by Claudia, connected to Explore.</p><a href="/">Visit Explore</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></footer></body></html>
